Subject: [PATCH 20/33] STRATA_Z_CONVAB (round 9, ported): a GDN layer's
 conv/ab launch as front blocks of its z GEMV (opt-in)

The z GEMV moves up to the conv/ab launch and carries it: GEMV front roles (the g11 rows body, an X template on the
r4 / r2 / iq3s kernels) and the conv/ab bodies shared from gdn_conv_ab.cuh (moved out of verify_kernels.cu; the same
bodies as the port's). One fewer critical-path launch per GDN layer. Off with the side mixer's query branch (z is on
its branch then) and where no gfx1100 GEMV kernel takes z. mmvq_g11_parity: OK, 504 conv_ab role runs bitwise.
